---

<div class="button-bad-demo">
  <p class="button-bad-demo__label">アクション選択</p>
  <div class="button-bad-demo__group">
    <button class="btn-bad btn-bad--primary"> 保存する </button>
    <button class="btn-bad btn-bad--secondary"> 下書き保存 </button>
  </div>
  <p class="button-bad-demo__note">
    強制カラーモードでは2つのボタンの強弱の区別がつかなくなります。
  </p>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
  .button-bad-demo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: $space-md;
  }

  .button-bad-demo__label {
    font-size: $font-size-sm;
    font-weight: $font-weight-semibold;
    color: $color-text-muted;
  }

  .button-bad-demo__group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: $space-sm;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .button-bad-demo__note {
    font-size: $font-size-xs;
    color: $color-text-muted;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .btn-bad {
    @include button-reset;
    padding: calc($space-sm + 5px) $space-lg;
    border-radius: $border-radius-md;
    font-size: $font-size-sm;
    font-weight: $font-weight-semibold;
  }

  .btn-bad--primary {
    background-color: $color-primary;
    color: $color-text-on-primary;

    &:hover {
      background-color: $color-primary-dark;
    }
  }

  .btn-bad--secondary {
    background-color: $color-surface;
    color: $color-text;
    border: 1px solid $color-border;

    &:hover {
      background-color: $color-surface-alt;
    }
  }
</style>
